  "scope_statement": "This is a manifest-level scenario card. If the scenario file contains a Country value, that value is the scenario authoring default; the run certificate records the countries actually materialised and executed.",
  "summary": "Acute treatment of asthma exacerbations with inhaled bronchodilators and oral steroids.\nThis scenario exposes the parameters for the Oral Prednisolone intervention.\nThis was the mapping for the CR1 Scenario in Appendix 3 simulations.\nOral prednisolone reduces the disability weight of persons living with Asthma.\nIt increases the target coverage from the baseline of five percent, to the target coverage of ninety-five percent,\nwhich was a standard coverage change for Appendix 3 simulations.\nThis should typically be run as a comparison scenario, with the baseline scenario being the Asthma Baseline, or this same scenario but with the target coverage having a smaller scale-up coverage.\n",
  "title": "Appendix 3 - CR1 Scenario"
}
